      "sourceId": "banyue-mindscape_4",
      "label": "Purge Unit - Type Zero (Mindscape Cinema N°4)",
      "description": "EX Special Attack: Lion's Roar - Wrath, EX Special Attack: Mountain Tremor - Wrath, Basic Attack: Toppling Mountain, and Basic Attack: Crushing Peaks DMG increase by 30%.",
      "shortDescription": "Banyue's DMG from Basic Attack: Toppling Mountain, Basic Attack: Crushing Peaks, EX Special Attack: Lion's Roar - Wrath and EX Special Attack: Mountain Tremor - Wrath is increased by 30%.",
      "target": "self",
